+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>GPT-6 Astra, Looped Transformers, and Latent Reasoning</title></head>
+<body>
+<article>
+<h1>GPT-6 Astra, Looped Transformers, and Latent Reasoning</h1>
+<div class="available-content"><div class="body markup" dir="auto">
+<p>A lot has happened in the last few weeks. I am sure that OpenAI’s GPT-6 Astra is top of mind for everyone right now. In particular, thoughts on its performance, the looped transformer/recurrent depth aspects, and rumors that Astra is “hiding” its reasoning trace (i.e., chain of thought).</p>
+<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM" class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png" width="1456" height="1248" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1248,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;benchmarks-1&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" alt="benchmarks-1" title="benchmarks-1" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4zO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7647174-392d-4637-a1ab-baf3b24a3704_8765x7510.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy" class="sizing-normal"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><span>Figure 1: Selection of three popular coding benchmarks and one challenging math benchmark. More benchmarks are shared on the Astra release blog: </span><a href="https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/">https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/</a></figcaption></figure></div>
+<p>So, in this article, I want to start with some brief impressions of Astra and some thoughts on where all this is headed. Then, I will discuss, in detail, what “looped transformers” are, and how (or rather, if) this relates to hiding chains of thought.</p>
